"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0078/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g025\", \"description\": \"商代甲骨文“必”字形3\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0078/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g026\", \"description\": \"西周金文“必”字形4\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0078/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g027\", \"description\": \"西周金文“必”字形5\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0078/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g028\", \"description\": \"战国文字“必”字形6\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0078/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g029\", \"description\": \"战国文字“必”字形7\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0078/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g030\", \"description\": \"战国文字“必”字形8\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0078/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g031\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“必”字形9\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0078/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g032\", \"description\": \"战国文字“必”字形10\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0078/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g033\", \"description\": \"汉代简帛“必”字形11\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0078/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g034\", \"description\": \"汉代简帛“必”字形12\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0078/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g035\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“必”字形13\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0078/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}], \"block_anchors\": [], \"entry_metadata\": \"not_extracted\", \"uncertainties\": [], \"review_queue\": [], \"review\": null, \"spatial_repair_warnings\": [], \"use\": \"provisional_research_lead_inspect_original_page\"}\n80:{\"schema_version\": 2, \"page_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721:000080\", \"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"book\": {\"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"pdf_sha256\": \"610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"source_pdf_paths\": [\"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\"], \"current_source_filename\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"title\": null, \"author\": null, \"editor\": null, \"edition\": null, \"year\": null, \"publisher\": null, \"volume\": null, \"isbn\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": {}, \"total_pdf_pages\": 1435}, \"source_file\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"source_pdf\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"pdf_page_1based\": 80, \"printed_page\": null, \"source_sha256\": \"92b9abf0aea792bdc98c62bca539b8e57974c74d9402061dde298f8f200a0f08\", \"evidence_sha256\": \"c76f81c7aa5a84cd78a9ad8b093246c625355e4374982cdd459df708c457cecb\", \"ocr_review_status\": \"unreviewed\", \"review_dimensions\": {\"transcription\": \"unreviewed\", \"layout\": \"not_requested\", \"glyph_identification\": \"page_references_only_no_crops\"}, \"text\": \"采部 半部 牛部\\n\\n外国,如番邦、西番等,音读 fān。文献中“番番”,义为勇武貌,亦借为“播”,传扬义,音读 bō。另参见“采”字条。(陈英杰)\\n\\n審(审) shěn 书纽、侵部;书纽、寝韵、式荏切。\\n\\n[glyph:g001] 西周\\n[glyph:g002] 战国\\n[glyph:g003] 春秋\\n[glyph:g004] 战国\\n[glyph:g005] 汉\\n[glyph:g006] 《说文》小篆\\n[glyph:g007] 汉\\n[glyph:g008] 汉\\n審 楷书\\n审 楷书\\n\\n1《金文编》54页。2、3、4《战文编》58页。5、8《汉印徵》卷2,2页。6《说文》28页。7《马王堆》41页。\\n\\n会意字。其字初形构意不明。《说文》:“冧,悉也。知审谛也。从宀从采。審,篆文冧从番。”徐锴系传:“宀,覆也。采,别也。包覆而深别之。冧,悉也。”《说文》从采或番的“審”字,都是讹变的形体。金文中“審”字从宀从米从口,非从番,米、采形近而讹混。春秋金文中口旁之内加饰点,小篆进一步讹为“田”,为今日楷书所本。有人据战国文字的写法把“審”字的形义结构分析为从窀从曰。《侯马盟书》16.3有字作[glyph:g009],从窀从思,是审字异体。小篆“審”的出现可能有两个途径:一是把曰改为田,一是[glyph:g009]字省去心旁,这两种演变都可能经过被“番”同化的过程,“審”、“冧”的中笔屈首当跟这种同化有关(参赵平安《说文小篆研究》189页)。“审”是现代群众新造的形声字,从宀,申声。“审”由“知审谛”(详知义)义引申出详审、审慎、审察、审辨、审信等义。金文中用为审信、确实义。五祀卫鼎:“余审贾(gǔ,交换)田五田。”《吕氏春秋·先己》:“审此言也。”高诱注:“审,实也。”或用为人名,如楚王含審(见楚王含審盂)。(陈英杰)\\n\\n悉 xī 心纽、质部;心纽、质韵、息七切。\\n\\n[glyph:g010] 战国\\n[glyph:g011] 秦\\n[glyph:g012] 《说文》小篆\\n[glyph:g013] 汉\\n[glyph:g014] 汉\\n悉 楷书\\n\\n1、2《战文编》58页。3《说文》28页。4《马王堆》41页。5《甲金篆》67页。\\n\\n会意字。本义为详尽。《说文》:“悉,详尽也。从心,从采。”采,辨也,心里对事物辨别得很清楚,所以就对事物了解得很详细。“悉”最早见于战国时期的诅楚文,其文曰:“悉兴其众。”义为尽、皆、全,即由详尽义引申而来。由详尽义又引申出熟悉义。字亦见于战国玺印中,用为姓氏。《吕氏春秋·尊师》:“神农率悉诸。”高诱注:“悉,姓。”(陈英杰)\\n\\n釋(释) shì 书纽、铎部;书纽、昔韵、施只切。\\n\\n[glyph:g015] 战国\\n[glyph:g016] 《说文》小篆\\n釋 楷书\\n释 楷书\\n\\n1《古字典》557页。2《说文》28页。\\n\\n形声字。《说文》:“釋,解也,从采。采,取其分别物也。从睾声。”其本义为解说、解释。《左传·襄公二十九年》:“公在楚,释不朝正于庙也。”(“公在楚”,这是解释不在祖庙听政的原因)由解释义引申出消溶、溶解(如涣然冰释)、解除、释放等义,由释放义引申出放弃等义。战国玺印中习见人名“释之”。“释”是“釋”的草书楷化字。(陈英杰)\\n\\n半部\\n\\n半 bàn 帮纽、元部;帮纽、换韵、博慢切。\\n\\n[glyph:g017] 春秋\\n[glyph:g018] 战国\\n[glyph:g019] 《说文》小篆\\n[glyph:g020] 汉\\n[glyph:g021] 汉\\n半 楷书\\n\\n1《金文编》54页。2《战文编》59页。3《说文》28页。4、5《马王堆》41页。\\n\\n会意字。从牛,从八。“八”原义为分,会分割牛体之意。其本义为一半、二分之一。《说文》:“半,物中分也。”《易·系辞下》“知者观其象辞,则思过半矣”、秦公簋“大半升”,用的都是本义。由“物中分”义引申出“在……中间”、“不完全”等义,如半山腰、一知半解等。(陈英杰)\\n\\n胖 pàn 滂纽、元部;滂纽、换韵、普半切。\\npán 并纽、桓韵、蒲官切。\\npàng\\n\\n[glyph:g022] 《说文》小篆\\n[glyph:g023] 汉\\n胖 楷书\\n\\n1《说文》28页。2《甲金篆》68页。\\n\\n会意兼形声字。《说文》:“胖,半体肉也。一日广肉。\\n\\n68\", \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0080/source.png\", \"reading_json\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0080/ocr.json\", \"manifest\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0080/ocr.json\", \"original_evidence_sha256\": null, \"correction_provenance\": null, \"glyph_assets\": [{\"id\": \"g001\", \"description\": \"西周金文「審」字，上为宀，内含采与口部构件\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0080/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g002\", \"description\": \"战国文字「審」字，宀下包含类似采或米与口或圆框形构件\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0080/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g003\", \"description\": \"春秋金文「審」字，宀下为采，下部口内加饰点\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0080/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g004\", \"description\": \"战国文字「審」字，构形瘦长\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0080/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": nul