「掰」的諧音。 ... - 蔡英文神回脆友「我給ㄅ級分」秒跟上新梗！ ... * 中國文字改革硏究委員會祕書處拼音方案工作組：《全國主要方言區方音對照表》，北京：中華書局，1954年12月。","title":"ㄅ","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%84%85"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"en.wikipedia.org","ref_id":"turn0search18","snippet":"The majority of characters used in Standard Chinese are phono-semantic compounds – characters formed using two parts, or radicals; one hinting at its meaning, and","title":"Written Cantonese","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Written_Cantonese"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"en.wikipedia.org","ref_id":"turn0search19","snippet":"Semantic-phonetic characters (also called \"phono-semantic characters\", 意音字, 形聲字) consist of semantic components and phonetic components.The semantic component indicates the category of word meaning, a","title":"Chinese character internal structures","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chinese_character_internal_structures"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.reddit.com","ref_id":"turn0reddit20","snippet":"* a list of all hanzi containing the phonetic component, organised by their pronunciation. ... * 巴 = ba1345 pa2 (ba1 巴, ba3 把, ba4","title":"List of all phonetic components used in Chinese characters?","url":"https://www.reddit.com/r/ChineseLanguage/comments/k6i10u"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"www.reddit.com","ref_id":"turn0reddit21","snippet":"夫字自甲骨至金文至篆至隸至楷 層層演進 其本意已杳不可考 故潛心於小學訓詁 無益於學 ... E.g. radical of 唔(m4) is \"口\" and component is \"吾\"; \"口\" - mouth (semantic component) & \"吾\"(ng4) - denotes","title":"Website explaining meaning of each word’s radicals for Cantonese?","url":"https://www.reddit.com/r/Cantonese/comments/v1xlqp"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"en.wikipedia.org","ref_id":"turn0search22","snippet":"Chinese characters sharing the same phonetic character component ... For example, the character is composed of the semantic component 'water' and the sound component (believed","title":"Phonetic series (Chinese characters)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Phonetic_series_%28Chinese_characters%29"}]}}
