{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_12","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"evidence\":[{\"source\":\"CUHK Multi-function Chinese Character Database\",\"field\":\"形義通解; 《廣韻》 and Middle Chinese table\",\"text\":\"The entry analyzes 吧 as 从口、巴声. It lists two 《廣韻》 fanqie entries, 普巴 and 伯加, corresponding to Middle Chinese initials 滂 and 幫 respectively; both are level-tone 麻-rhyme, open division II. It separately lists particle functions and a Qing-novel onomatopoeic example. This supports the component analysis and distinction between the two readings, but does not date the graph’s formation.\",\"record_character\":\"吧\",\"kind\":\"dictionary_entry\",\"url\":\"https://humanum.arts.cuhk.edu.hk/Lexis/lexi-mf/search.php?word=%E5%90%A7\",\"title\":\"漢語多功能字庫 — 字頭「吧」\",\"accessed_at\":\"2026-10-03\"},{\"source\":\"Unicode Consortium\",\"field\":\"UAX #38, §§2.2–2.3, Unihan data and web access\",\"text\":\"Unicode describes Unihan.zip as a versioned public data snapshot in which each property row records a Unicode scalar value, property name, and value; its interactive lookup may not immediately match the latest data-file release. This supports treating local extract values as versioned reading metadata, not historical sound evidence.\",\"record_character\":\"吧\",\"kind\":\"official_standard_documentation\",\"url\":\"https://www.unicode.org/reports/tr38/\",\"title\":\"Unicode Standard Annex #38: Unicode Han Database (Unihan)\",\"accessed_at\":\"2026-10-03\"},{\"source\":\"pipeline/data/unihan-kmandarin-hsk1.tsv (project-scoped extract of Unicode Unihan 17.0.0)\",\"field\":\"kMandarin rows U+5427 and U+5DF4\",\"text\":\"Checked exact local rows: U+5427 吧 kMandarin ba; U+5DF4 巴 kMandarin bā. This is a modern Mandarin reading comparison only and does not establish an ancient sound relationship. Official per-character Unicode lookup URLs were attempted but inaccessible in the web reader; cite the local file as provenance, not as an external source URL.\",\"record_character\":\"吧\",\"kind\":\"local_primary_reading_data\",\"url\":\"https://www.unicode.org/cgi-bin/GetUnihanData.pl?codepoint=5427\",\"title\":\"Unihan lookup for U+5427\",\"accessed_at\":\"2026-10-03\"},{\"source\":\"pipeline/data/unihan-kmandarin-hsk1.tsv (project-scoped extract of Unicode Unihan 17.0.0)\",\"field\":\"kMandarin row U+5DF4\",\"text\":\"Checked exact local row: U+5DF4 巴 kMandarin bā. The matching host row is U+5427 吧 ba. Official per-character Unicode lookup URLs were attempted but inaccessible in the web reader, so this record preserves local provenance rather than claiming an opened click-through record.\",\"record_character\":\"巴\",\"kind\":\"local_primary_reading_data\",\"url\":\"https://www.unicode.org/cgi-bin/GetUnihanData.pl?codepoint=5DF4\",\"title\":\"Unihan lookup for U+5DF4\",\"accessed_at\":\"2026-10-03\"}],\"search_audit\":[{\"query\":\"site:unicode.org/cgi-bin/GetUnihanData.pl?codepoint=5427; site:unicode.org/cgi-bin/GetUnihanData.pl?codepoint=5DF4; 吧 巴 phonetic component 口 巴 semantic CUHK\",\"urls\":[\"https://www.unicode.org/cgi-bin/GetUnihanData.pl?codepoint=5427\",\"https://www.unicode.org/cgi-bin/GetUnihanData.pl?codepoint=5DF4\",\"https://humanum.arts.cuhk.edu.hk/Lexis/lexi-mf/search.php?word=%E5%90%A7\",\"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/%E5%90%A7\",\"https://char.hanzistack.com/character/%E5%90%A7\"],\"outcome\":\"Search surfaced official Unicode lookup endpoints and CUHK’s entry. Opened CUHK directly and confirmed 从口、巴声 plus its separate Guangyun classifications. Wiktionary and other secondary pages were search results only.\"},{\"query\":\"site:unicode.org/cgi-bin/GetUnihanData.pl \\\"U+5427\\\" 吧 kMandarin; site:unicode.org/cgi-bin/GetUnihanData.pl \\\"U+5DF4\\\" 巴 kMandarin\",\"urls\":[\"https://www.unicode.org/cgi-bin/GetUnihanData.pl?codepoint=5427\",\"https://www.unicode.org/cgi-bin/GetUnihanData.pl?codepoint=5DF4\",\"https://www.unicode.org/reports/tr38/\",\"https://www.unicode.org/L2/2024/24067-cjk-unihan-wg-utc179.pdf\"],\"outcome\":\"The per-character lookup endpoints and the direct PDF attempt were inaccessible. Opened UAX #38 and confirmed its description of Unihan data-file rows and lookup versioning. Search returned an official Unicode document snippet containing U+5427 ba, but it is not the requested opened per-character record. Exact local extract rows were checked.\"}],\"gaps\":[\"[SCAN VERIFICATION REQUIRED] 字源 (李學勤主編, 2012, ISBN 9787552800692) corpus hits on PDF pages 54, 56, 101, 106, 460, 532–533 and 561 require precise passage/headword assessment before citation. No original scan pixels were opened during this pass; earlier dossier notes report that pages 106 and other candidates were unrelated, but that is prior inspection, not my direct verification.\",\"[SCAN VERIFICATION REQUIRED] The requested attachment scans were not supplied in this invocation, and no directly inspected original scan pixels are claimed.\",\"Official per-character Unicode records for U+5427 and U+5DF4 could not be opened. Local rows support ba and bā, but do not satisfy the external click-through requirement for those readings.\",\"No Baxter–Sagart row comparison was performed: the specified TSV is absent from this checkout’s tracked files.\"]}"}}
